--- !u!114 &671875322
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 671875319}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 57603701dd0147e43b5295c375e99a88, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    dialogueLines:
    - character:
        name: 
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: "Hold it there Faye!\t"
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: More traps from them dang Agarics.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: These are more tricky than last time though.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: This time is about more than just timing.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: now you need speed. and walking over is not enough those spikes are too
        fast.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Luckily for you there is yet another technique you can utitlize from
        the great ancient Goldcaps.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: through flapping your wings hard enough while leaning forward you can
        perform a so called "dash".
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Now to do this all you have to do is hold the LSHIFT (left shift) key
        in conjunction with any directional key to dash forward.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: Now the real skilled once can do this while jumping but for now try just
        dashing and get the hang of that.
    - character:
        name: Elder Cap
        icon: {fileID: 8238638941979423301, guid: 6ead8f8e694501b4eb48a851baedab56, type: 3}
      line: 'You know what they say: you gotta dash before you can dash and jump
        kiddo!'
    automaticAdvance: 0
    autoAdvanceDelay: 1.5
  ableToWalkDuringDialogue: 1
