      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[0].line
      value: Hello there Winged One. Many thanks for releasing me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[1].line
      value: Did you speak to the old geezer? He can be a little whack, but sometimes
        he says something of importance.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[2].line
      value: Oh by the way, if you're heading further, beware of falling ground.
        It'l get ya!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7350832452455051506, guid: b6834b7c6383039439c88fbc14c6febc, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue.dialogueLines.Array.data[3].line
      value: Appreciate the warning. Find somewhere safe to stay now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
